# Skill: Librerias permitidas

## Frontend

| Categoria | Librerias |
|-----------|-----------|
| Formularios | Formik, Yup |
| Estado | Redux Toolkit, Redux Persist |
| HTTP | Axios |
| Estilos | Tailwind CSS, NativeWind |
| Fechas | Day.js, date-fns |
| Auth | NextAuth.js |
| IoC | InversifyJS |
| Utilidades | lodash, classnames |

## Backend

| Categoria | Librerias |
|-----------|-----------|
| Framework | NestJS |
| ORM | Prisma |
| Validacion | class-validator, class-transformer |
| HTTP | Axios |
| Auth | jwt-decode |

## Prohibidas

moment.js (deprecado), Material-UI/Chakra (solo Tailwind).

**No introducir dependencias nuevas sin autorizacion.**
